      {
        "note_id": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
        "title": "Design for performance",
        "sources": [
          "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
        ],
        "candidate_steps": [
          {
            "text": "- If you want to support lower-end devices, choose at least one \"baseline\" device, [test your game on it](/docs/en-us/performance-optimization/test-on-hardware.md) throughout the development process, and pay close attention to frame rate and memory usage.",
            "source_note": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
            ],
            "verified": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Or you could examine the **Developer Console** (`F9`) and note that memory usage is a bit high unless you enable [streaming](/docs/en-us/workspace/streaming.md).",
            "source_note": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
            ],
            "verified": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Check your [streaming](/docs/en-us/workspace/streaming.md) `Class.Workspace.StreamingTargetRadius|StreamingTargetRadius` setting.",
            "source_note": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
            ],
            "verified": false
          },
          {
            "text": "- Built-in materials use far less memory than custom textures, but might not match your artistic vision.",
            "source_note": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
            ],
            "verified": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Try to use materials whenever possible in order to conserve memory budget for the textures that are central to your game.",
            "source_note": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
            ],
            "verified": false
          },
          {
            "text": "- When you add meshes and textures, use and reuse them rather than importing duplicate copies.",
            "source_note": "vdn-0df57a89fa73",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://create.roblox.com/docs/performance-optimization/design"
            ],
            "verified": false
          }
        ],
